From 3e2322368fd7b6c74ea730fa23c53200864bdc4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:07:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] d/steamvr_lh: record diagnostic base stations

Opt in with LH_DIAGNOSTIC_REFERENCES to activate tracking references in a separate index range. Keep driver calls outside the device lock, retain routing until Cleanup, and retire failed activation slots. Record raw and composed poses with the actual chaperone and universe metadata on the existing asynchronous recorder. Add fake-provider lifecycle and callback tests.
